{"id": "EUVD-2026-91870", "enisaUuid": "b7d8a660-f61a-3e83-86f2-c5d3fb1dccb3", "description": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-32 and 6.9.13-57 contains a policy bypass vulnerability in LoadPolicyCache that silently skips security policy rules when policy.xml uses an alternate DOCTYPE. A valid DOCTYPE not ending in ']>' makes the parser consume the rest of the file, so no policy rules are applied and restricted operations become allowed.", "datePublished": "2026-10-03T01:11:12", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-05T20:30:01", "baseScore": 1.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:H/AT:P/PR:H/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-jjp4-3fwf-393j", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/1926ccf119141c26274c120d1899dffae19b0c71", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/399d4bd3b081f44c7fef78153f65e8cdebed9f1a", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/da6022b2efe6cce8a2fd8f9e51188a45a3b9d558", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/402ebc5353e569234908962cbdf451531ff66a57", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/blob/7.1.2-31/MagickCore/policy.c#L1138-L1145", "https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/imagemagick-before-7.1.2-32-and-6.9.13-57-security-policy-bypass-via-policy-xml-doctype"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105083", "GHSA-9r9r-c7x8-qp3r"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "16dde123-ce95-3a90-8f23-c1f5ff546e16", "product": {"name": "ImageMagick", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}, "product_version": "7.0.0-0 <7.1.2-32"}, {"id": "4dfebb23-d06a-319d-95b2-48044ea8d768", "product": {"name": "ImageMagick", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.9.13-57"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b2ad2b74-803a-3931-b953-a33344e2b664", "vendor": {"name": "ImageMagick"}}], "isExploited": false}